@startuml
allowmixing

title Command-Based Organization of EvaML Element Processing

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #707070
}

abstract class BaseCommandHandler <<Command>> {
    + node_process(xml_node, memory)
}

class "talk_module\nCommandHandler" as TalkHandler <<Concrete Command>>

class "counter_module\nCommandHandler" as CounterHandler <<Concrete Command>>

class "goto_module\nCommandHandler" as GotoHandler <<Concrete Command>>

class "usemacro_module\nCommandHandler" as MacroHandler <<Concrete Command>>

class "Script Player" as Player <<Invoker>>

database "Robot Memory" as Memory

BaseCommandHandler <|-- TalkHandler
BaseCommandHandler <|-- CounterHandler
BaseCommandHandler <|-- GotoHandler
BaseCommandHandler <|-- MacroHandler

Player ..> BaseCommandHandler : node_process()

BaseCommandHandler --> Memory : read / update

note right of BaseCommandHandler
Common processing interface
implemented by every EvaML
command module.
end note

note right of Player
The Script Player invokes
CommandHandlers through the
same operation regardless of
the EvaML element.
end note

note bottom of GotoHandler
Each concrete handler
encapsulates the semantics
of one EvaML element.
end note

legend bottom
<<Command>>           Common abstraction for EvaML commands
<<Concrete Command>>  One implementation per EvaML element
<<Invoker>>           Script Player
endlegend

@enduml